# 🏪 CKA Tuckshop - International Snacks Website

## Welcome to CKA Tuckshop! 🌍

A modern, fully responsive tuckshop website featuring snacks and treats from around the world with smooth animations, marquee effects, and interactive features.

---

## ✨ Features

### 🎨 **Visual Design**
- Modern gradient backgrounds with vibrant color schemes
- Smooth transitions and hover effects
- Responsive grid layouts
- Card-based product and country displays

### 🔄 **Marquee Animations**
- Continuous scrolling text animations
- Multiple marquee speeds and directions
- Promotional banner with offers
- Product carousel with infinite scroll effect

### 🎭 **Interactive Elements**
- Smooth scroll navigation
- Animated counters (stats section)
- Form validation and success messages
- Ripple effects on buttons
- Keyboard navigation (Arrow keys)
- Scroll-to-top button
- Parallax scrolling effects

### 🌐 **International Theme**
- **Asia** 🏯 - Instant Noodles, Rice Crackers, Shrimp Chips, Mochi
- **Africa** 🦁 - Plantain Chips, Peanut Brittle, Cassava Crisps, Roasted Nuts
- **Europe** 🏰 - Belgian Waffles, Swiss Chocolate, French Pastries, Danish Cookies
- **Americas** 🗽 - Mexican Chips, Popcorn, Beef Jerky, Pizza Snacks
- **Middle East** 🕌 - Hummus Crisps, Pistachio Mix, Baklava, Tahini Snacks
- **India** 🕉️ - Samosa, Aloo Bhujia, Mixture, Rice Puffs

### 📱 **Responsive Design**
- Mobile-first approach
- Fully responsive on all devices
- Optimized breakpoints for tablets and desktops
- Touch-friendly buttons and navigation

